# ==============================================================================
# PPW DevStudio - Environment Variables Notice
# ==============================================================================
#
# ZERO CONFIGURATION REQUIRED:
# This portfolio is engineered as a 100% self-contained, static client-side web
# application. It requires NO environment variables (.env) to develop locally,
# test, build, or deploy to GitHub Pages.
#
# You do NOT need VITE_APP_URL or any deployed URL to develop locally.
# Simply run:
#   npm install
#   npm run dev
# The website will launch immediately at http://localhost:3000.
#
# IMPORTANT SECURITY NOTICE:
# Because GitHub Pages is a public static host, never store database passwords,
# private API keys, or secret credentials in any frontend .env file.
# ==============================================================================
